  "description": "The illegitimate beta heir of a powerful loan empire has only one goal: graduate from college without causing trouble. But on the first day back, everything unravels after being paired with a shameless alpha whose provocative behavior turns campus life upside down. A desperate attempt at blackmail triggers an unexpected omega awakening, thrusting both into a volatile relationship filled with power struggles, irresistible instincts, and forbidden attraction.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \nVolumes: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/breedC), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1007104317), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000131705), [Bookcube](https://www.joara.com/book/1776556)  \nChapters: [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/breedC_e), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000131703), [Joara](https://www.joara.com/book/1776556)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/breedingcampus)",
